decree | Semana de Turismo | 2024-3-25 2024-3-26 2024-3-27 2024-3-28 2024-3-29 2025-4-14 2025-4-15 2025-4-16 2025-4-17 2025-4-18 | bank |  |  |  | 
decree | Desembarco de los 33 Orientales | 2024-4-22 2025-4-19 | bank |  |  |  | 
fixed  | Batalla de Las Piedras | 5 18 | bank |  |  |  | 
fixed  | Natalicio de Artigas | 6 19 | bank |  |  |  | 
